# Testing Conventions
## Framework
- Use Jest for javascript tests, Vitest Testing Library for frontend
- Use pytest with fixtures for backend
- Mock external services, never make real API calls in tests
## Structure
- One test file per source file: `*.test.js` (api-consumer, Jest), colocated `*.spec.js` (web, Vitest), `test_*.py` (server, pytest)
- Group tests with describe blocks by method or behavior
- Use arrange-act-assert pattern
